{"id":"level-up-2026-10-31","name":"2026-10-31 每日卡片","project":"level-up-cards","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/tree/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45","sentences":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2151","en":"We decided to take a tram to the museum.","zh":"我们决定乘有轨电车去博物馆。","note":"tram · 乘电车；有轨电车，电车轨道 · take a tram","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2152","en":"A strong odour of fresh paint filled the hallway.","zh":"走廊里充满了浓烈的新油漆气味。","note":"odour · 气味 · a strong odour","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2153","en":"Closing the footpath would deprive residents of access to the river.","zh":"关闭这条步道会使居民无法前往河边。","note":"deprive · 剥夺； 使丧失 · deprive of","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2154","en":"The exhibition explores how urban redevelopment changed the old docklands.","zh":"这个展览探讨了城市重建如何改变昔日的码头区。","note":"redevelopment · 重新规划； 重新建设 · urban redevelopment","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2155","en":"She chose curtains with a delicate blue floral pattern.","zh":"她选了带精致蓝色花卉图案的窗帘。","note":"floral · 花的， 像花的； 绘有花的， 饰以花的； 植物群的 · a floral pattern","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2156","en":"The gardener discussed different approaches to pest control.","zh":"园丁讨论了几种不同的害虫防治方法。","note":"pest · 害虫 · pest control","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2157","en":"We had to pedal hard to reach the hilltop.","zh":"我们不得不用力蹬车，才能到达山顶。","note":"pedal · 骑车； · pedal uphill","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2158","en":"The festival celebrates the cultural heritage of local fishing communities.","zh":"这个节庆颂扬当地渔业社区的文化遗产。","note":"heritage · 遗产； 传统 · cultural heritage","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2159","en":"An ambulance crew gave a demonstration at the school fair.","zh":"一支救护车乘务团队在学校集市上作了演示。","note":"ambulance · 救护车； 野战医院 · an ambulance crew","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2160","en":"The path follows a gentle slope down towards the lake.","zh":"小径沿着一道缓坡下行，通向湖边。","note":"slope · 倾斜；斜坡；倾斜 · a gentle slope","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2161","en":"Her teaching philosophy places curiosity at the centre of learning.","zh":"她的教学理念把好奇心放在学习的中心。","note":"philosophy · 哲学； 哲理 · a teaching philosophy","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2162","en":"Coastal villages bore the brunt of the storm's damage.","zh":"沿海村庄遭受了这场风暴最严重的破坏。","note":"brunt · 冲击； 冲力 · bear the brunt","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2163","en":"The workshop helped reveal a latent talent for storytelling.","zh":"这个工作坊帮助发现了一种潜在的讲故事才能。","note":"latent · 潜在的， 潜伏的， 不易察觉的 · latent talent","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2164","en":"The apparently simple task turned out to require considerable patience.","zh":"这项看似简单的任务，结果需要相当多的耐心。","note":"apparently · 显然； 看来， 似乎 · apparently simple","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2165","en":"The historical novel follows a young corporal returning home.","zh":"这部历史小说讲述了一名年轻下士返乡的故事。","note":"corporal · 肉体的，身体的；下士 · a young corporal","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2166","en":"From a practical standpoint, the smaller room is easier to maintain.","zh":"从实用角度来看，小房间更容易维护。","note":"standpoint · 立场； 观点 · from a standpoint","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2167","en":"We plan to repaint the hallway before the exhibition opens.","zh":"我们计划在展览开幕前重新粉刷走廊。","note":"repaint · 重新油漆， 重画 · repaint a wall","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2168","en":"The files were in a muddle after the office move.","zh":"办公室搬迁后，文件乱成了一团。","note":"muddle · 一团糟， 凌乱， 混乱； 糊涂， 困惑；将…弄成一团糟； 使困惑， 使糊涂； 混淆 · in a muddle","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2169","en":"Her valuable advice saved us hours of unnecessary work.","zh":"她宝贵的建议为我们节省了数小时不必要的工作。","note":"valuable · 贵重的，有价值的；贵重物品， 财宝 · valuable advice","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2170","en":"The conference included a session on methods used in infection research.","zh":"会议包含了一个讨论感染研究方法的环节。","note":"infection · 传染， 感染， 侵染， 传播； 传染病 · infection research","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2171","en":"The children built a pirate ship from old cardboard boxes.","zh":"孩子们用旧纸箱搭了一艘海盗船。","note":"pirate · 侵犯版权者；海盗；盗用， 盗版 · a pirate ship","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2172","en":"Breaking the published rules may disqualify a competitor from the race.","zh":"违反公布的规则，可能使参赛者失去比赛资格。","note":"disqualify · 使丧失资格 · disqualify a competitor","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2173","en":"The imprecise instructions left us unsure where to attach the bracket.","zh":"这些不精确的说明让我们不确定支架该装在哪里。","note":"imprecise · 不精确的， 不严密的 · imprecise instructions","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2174","en":"The tutor helped us formulate a clear research question.","zh":"导师帮助我们提出了一个明确的研究问题。","note":"formulate · 系统阐述， 明确表达； 构想出， 规划 · formulate a question","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2175","en":"He wore a smart jacket to the opening ceremony.","zh":"他穿着一件漂亮的夹克参加了开幕式。","note":"smart · 漂亮的， 时髦的； 高明的 · a smart jacket","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2176","en":"The diagram contains an equilateral triangle inside a circle.","zh":"图中有一个位于圆内的等边三角形。","note":"triangle · 三角 · an equilateral triangle","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2177","en":"Spread a thin layer of glue along the edge.","zh":"沿着边缘涂上一层薄薄的胶水。","note":"layer · 层， 层次 · a thin layer","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2178","en":"The exhibition celebrates linguistic diversity through recorded family stories.","zh":"这个展览通过录制家庭故事，展现语言多样性的丰富价值。","note":"linguistic · 语言的； 语言学的 · linguistic diversity","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2179","en":"The project improved access to basic sanitation in remote villages.","zh":"这个项目改善了偏远村庄获取基本卫生设施的条件。","note":"sanitation · 卫生， 卫生设施 · basic sanitation","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2180","en":"An elite athlete visited the school to discuss training routines.","zh":"一位优秀运动员到学校介绍日常训练安排。","note":"elite · 卓越的， 精锐的；精英，中坚 · an elite athlete","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2181","en":"She placed a small glass ornament on the windowsill.","zh":"她在窗台上摆了一件小玻璃饰品。","note":"ornament · 装饰； · a glass ornament","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2182","en":"The bakery used the smell of fresh bread to entice customers.","zh":"这家面包店用新鲜面包的香味吸引顾客。","note":"entice · 怂恿， 引诱 · entice customers","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2183","en":"We watched predatory birds circle above the open fields.","zh":"我们看着猛禽在开阔田野上空盘旋。","note":"predatory · 食肉的； 掠夺的 · predatory birds","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2184","en":"Rainwater collected in a wooden barrel beside the shed.","zh":"雨水积聚在棚子旁的一只木桶里。","note":"barrel · 桶， 圆筒 · a wooden barrel","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2185","en":"A chain of unexpected events delayed the opening ceremony.","zh":"一连串意外事件推迟了开幕式。","note":"chain · 链，链条；一连串，一系列；；用链条拴住 · a chain of events","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2186","en":"She expressed a strong desire to learn traditional pottery.","zh":"她表达了学习传统陶艺的强烈愿望。","note":"desire · 想望， 期望； 要求 · a strong desire","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2187","en":"The efficient booking system reduced waiting times at reception.","zh":"高效的预订系统缩短了前台的等候时间。","note":"efficient · 有效的， 效率高的； 有能力的， 能胜任的 · an efficient system","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2188","en":"Unfortunately, the last bus had left before we reached the station.","zh":"不幸的是，我们到达车站前，末班公交车已开走。","note":"unfortunately · 不幸地 · unfortunately","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2189","en":"Repeating the experiment produced consistent results across all three groups.","zh":"重复实验后，三个组都获得了稳定一致的结果。","note":"consistent · 一致的， 协调的； 相符的， 相容的 · consistent results","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2190","en":"The guide asked us to repeat the numbers in reverse order.","zh":"导览员让我们按相反顺序重复那些数字。","note":"reverse · 相反的；倒转的，颠倒的；颠倒， 倒退；相反，颠倒；背面，后面 · in reverse order","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2191","en":"The photograph shows barren land stretching towards the distant hills.","zh":"照片上，荒芜的土地一直延伸到远处山丘。","note":"barren · 贫瘠的， 荒芜的； 不结果实的， 不育的； 无益的， 无效果的 · barren land","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2192","en":"We stopped for lunch beside a small olive grove.","zh":"我们在一小片橄榄林旁停下来吃午饭。","note":"grove · 树丛， 小树林 · an olive grove","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2193","en":"The course introduces students to the architecture of classical antiquity.","zh":"这门课程向学生介绍古典时代的建筑。","note":"antiquity · 古， 古老； 古代； 古人； 古迹， 古物 · classical antiquity","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2194","en":"The museum opened a permanent exhibition about the town's railway.","zh":"博物馆开设了一个介绍小镇铁路的常设展。","note":"permanent · 永久的， 持久的 · a permanent exhibition","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2195","en":"The shared project helped foster cooperation between the two schools.","zh":"这项共同项目帮助促进了两所学校之间的合作。","note":"foster · 培养，培育；鼓励，促进；领养；收养的 · foster cooperation","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2196","en":"The new sports facility includes a pool and climbing wall.","zh":"这座新的体育设施包括一个泳池和一面攀岩墙。","note":"facility · 设施；设备；容易；灵巧 · a sports facility","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2197","en":"Our gregarious host introduced everyone before dinner began.","zh":"晚餐开始前，爱交际的主人向大家逐一作了介绍。","note":"gregarious · 群居的； 合群的； 爱交际的 · a gregarious host","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2198","en":"A narrow beam of light fell across the dusty floor.","zh":"一束细长的光照在满是灰尘的地板上。","note":"beam · 面露喜色； 发射电波， 播送；束；梁；笑容，喜色 · a beam of light","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2199","en":"She bought a tiny silver trinket at the seaside market.","zh":"她在海边市场买了一件小银饰。","note":"trinket · 小装饰品； 不值钱的珠宝 · a silver trinket","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:s2200","en":"The exhibition explores daily life in an ancient civilization.","zh":"这个展览探索了一个古代文明中的日常生活。","note":"civilization · 文明， 文化 · an ancient civilization","recordings":[]}],"words":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:w2151","en":"tram","zh":"乘电车；有轨电车，电车轨道","note":"英 /træm/ · 美 /træm/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/2151-uk-e1697ba30d22.mp3","text":"tram"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/2151-us-096fbbf82944.mp3","text":"tram"}]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:w2152","en":"odour","zh":"气味","note":"英 /'əudə(r)/ · 美 /'əudə/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/2152-uk-1e22c7b03ba2.mp3","text":"odour"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/2152-us-4362594ee302.mp3","text":"odour"}]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:w2153","en":"deprive","zh":"剥夺； 使丧失","note":"英 /dɪ'praɪv/ · 美 /dɪ'praɪv/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/2153-uk-b13ab4c4fcc7.mp3","text":"deprive"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/2153-us-45cec0b6afea.mp3","text":"deprive"}]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-31:w2154","en":"redevelopment","z